{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108700","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108700","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1510870001:1":{"text":"아니! 로르... 병사들이... 어떻게 이럴 수가?!","source_cn":"不！隆尔……士兵们……怎么会这样？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ADC5842534DA6D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510870002:0":{"text":"사냥의 신은 약속을 지키지 않았어요. 처음부터 당신을 속인 거라고요.","source_cn":"狩猎神没有遵守诺言。从一开始，她就是在骗你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10FDE14856BC11EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510870003:0":{"text":"지금 바로 돌아가서 전투를 지휘해야 해요. 보칼리스 병사들은 당신이 있어야만 살아남을 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"你必须回去指挥战局。有你在，呼临士兵才有存活的希望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F5EAC5572808400","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510870004:0":{"text":"조... 조금 전에 보여준 모든 게 마법으로 만들어 낸 환영이 아니라는 걸 어떻게 증명할 수 있습니까?","source_cn":"你……怎么证明刚才的一切不是用魔法构建的幻术？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F86952682B20B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510870005:0":{"text":"증명할 필요 없어요. 저를 믿지 못하겠다면 바람늪 전장으로 가서 직접 보면 되지 않을까요?","source_cn":"我不必证明。如果你不愿意相信我的魔法，更应该去风沼战场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D8A1314483D4E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510870006:0":{"text":"당신을 위해 목숨까지도 바치겠다는 전우들을 위해서, 잠시 이 신전을 떠나는 게 그리 어려운 건 아니잖아요?","source_cn":"哪怕是为了那些愿意把生命托付给你的战友，暂时离开这座神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22623F0AC768FEB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510870007:0":{"text":"만약 저희가 당신을 속였다 해도, 언제든 다시 돌아올 수 있어요.","source_cn":"如果我们欺骗了你，你随时都可以回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E158731B55D0312","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510870008:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E83B2F94B153A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1510870008":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E83B2F94B153A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510870009:0":{"text":"…알고 있습니다.","source_cn":"……我知道。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B85954A00D571EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"…알고 있습니다.","female":"…알고 있습니다.","variant_male_record_index":"175723","variant_female_record_index":"175724","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume